---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Research"
  description="Human-centered AI systems for calibrated decisions under uncertainty."
>
  <div class="container-content py-14">
    <div class="max-w-[920px]">

      <!-- 1. Research agenda -->
      <section id="agenda" class="mb-14">
        <span class="section-kicker mb-3">Research agenda</span>
        <h1 class="mb-4">Calibrated decisions under uncertainty</h1>
        <p class="lead max-w-3xl">
          I build and evaluate human-centered AI systems that help people make calibrated decisions under uncertainty by studying how AI systems interpret feedback, assess evidence quality, and support verification.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. Portfolio map -->
      <section id="portfolio-map" class="mb-14">
        <span class="section-kicker mb-2">Portfolio map</span>
        <h2 class="mb-5">From uncertainty to human decision consequence</h2>

        <div class="border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-lg px-5 py-6 mb-6 bg-[var(--color-surface)]">
          <ol class="list-none m-0 p-0 text-center" aria-label="Research portfolio sequence">
            <li class="font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Uncertainty source</li>
            <li class="font-mono text-lg text-[var(--color-primary)] leading-none py-2" aria-hidden="true">↓</li>
            <li class="font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Diagnostic/evaluation mechanism</li>
            <li class="font-mono text-lg text-[var(--color-primary)] leading-none py-2" aria-hidden="true">↓</li>
            <li class="font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Verification or adaptation</li>
            <li class="font-mono text-lg text-[var(--color-primary)] leading-none py-2" aria-hidden="true">↓</li>
            <li class="font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Human decision consequence</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <a href="#pmd" class="block border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-lg px-4 py-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-dim)] uppercase tracking-wider">PMD</span>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mt-1">Feedback Reliability</p>
          </a>
          <a href="#ced" class="block border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-lg px-4 py-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-dim)] uppercase tracking-wider">CED</span>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mt-1">Evidence Reliability</p>
          </a>
          <a href="#eval-runtime" class="block border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-lg px-4 py-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-dim)] uppercase tracking-wider">Eval Runtime</span>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mt-1">Evaluation Reliability</p>
          </a>
          <a href="#flagship-system" class="block border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-lg px-4 py-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-dim)] uppercase tracking-wider">CheckMyCoach</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider">In Progress</span>
            </div>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mt-1">Interaction Reliability</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Flagship system -->
      <section id="flagship-system" class="mb-14">
        <span class="section-kicker mb-2">Flagship system</span>
        <div class="arc-item" style="border-top-width:0; padding-top:0">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <span class="arc-index">Interaction Reliability</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider">In Progress</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="arc-question mt-2 mb-3">CheckMyCoach</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
            A human-AI interaction system for verification and calibrated reliance. The current prototype routes selected outputs, assigns rule-based tags, generates candidate revisions, and applies deterministic target-removal and information-retention checks.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-5">
            In a fixed 40-case run on a constructed development corpus, the pipeline routed 15 cases; 12 delivered outputs removed the predefined target feature, while none passed every target-and-retention check. This is bounded development evidence, not evidence of generalization or validated user benefit.
          </p>
          <a href="/research/building-trustworthy-ai/checkmycoach/" class="link-arrow">View CheckMyCoach evidence →</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. Methods and evaluation layer -->
      <section id="methods-evaluation" class="mb-14">
        <span class="section-kicker mb-2">Methods and evaluation layer</span>
        <div class="related-list">
          <article id="pmd" class="related-item scroll-mt-6">
            <span class="rel-role">Feedback Reliability</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl mt-1 mb-2">PMD</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed">
              Preference quality, personalization, feedback variability, and calibration diagnostics.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article id="ced" class="related-item scroll-mt-6">
            <span class="rel-role">Evidence Reliability</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl mt-1 mb-2">CED</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed">
              A CPU-based causal inference diagnostic artifact implementing OR, IPW, and AIPW and studying overlap, uncertainty, balance, and treatment-effect estimation behavior under controlled evaluation. It evaluates established estimators; it is not presented as a new causal method.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article id="eval-runtime" class="related-item scroll-mt-6">
            <span class="rel-role">Evaluation Reliability</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl mt-1 mb-2">Eval Runtime</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Reproducible evaluation infrastructure for execution integrity, artifact checks, and comparable AI evaluations. Execution attempts, ambiguous outcomes, and report denominators remain separately inspectable rather than being collapsed into a single result.
            </p>
            <a href="/demo/eval-runtime/" class="link-arrow">View Eval Runtime evidence →</a>
          </article>

        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 5. Evidence boundary -->
      <section id="evidence">
        <span class="section-kicker mb-2">Reading the evidence</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          These projects address different reliability problems. CheckMyCoach remains in progress; no validated user benefit is claimed.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
